# COUNTY PANELS (session 22, playthrough-driven port): open all four county
# control-panel detail screens ORGANICALLY via the 2x2 action grid
# (FUN_00438ceb): population 0x14 -> happiness 0x16 (direct panel->panel
# switch through the grid) -> tax 0x15 -> rations 0x19, then exercise the
# rations stepper (+1 / -1 arrows, FUN_0043a379 -> FUN_0043a5a9 economy
# reruns on BOTH engines), then RMB-close back to the strategic map.
# First organic exercise of the county-panel family (engine_county_panels.c,
# docs/findings/gameplay-and-screens.md).
#
# Seat: the default lastturn.sav reference (the current county at load is
# the player's own, so the action grid's owner gate passes -- no fixture).
# auto_dismiss stays ON for the WHOLE trace: the boot welcome series (and
# any first-run hint) dismisses reactively on both engines, and the county
# panels themselves are NOT scrolls (extended_pause never set), so the
# reactive dismiss cannot touch them -- no toggle-timing race (quirk #213).
#
# Grid geometry (FUN_00438ceb): x in (0x1e7,0x276) split at 0x224/0x237,
# y in (0xb5,0xf1) split at 0xd4.  Button centres used below:
#   population (517,196)  happiness (599,196)  tax (517,226)  rations (599,226)
# Rations stepper (FUN_0043a379): + arrow (337,232), - arrow (212,232).
#
